  "description": "<p>Pera Company is a small business located in Key West, Florida.</p><p>A native of Turkey, I've been visiting the countryside of Turkey and meeting with family of weavers who have been manufacturing Turkish textiles for generations. I've built a very close relationship with the artisans and I handpick each of my products during my visits.&nbsp;</p><p>Turkish textiles are flat weave and lightweight which makes them easy to dry and doesn't take much space. They are used for multi purposes; a sarong, a shawl, blanket/throw, a scarf, yoga mat, baby wrap, and plenty more ways to wear your Turkish textiles.&nbsp;</p><p>At PEra, I also carry an additional line of&nbsp; 100% cotton &amp; linen gauzy dresses and cover ups. I've stated a promo myself and post customer's photo as them being the Pera Model of the day. You may visit our instagram for all posts.&nbsp;</p>",
